    REGINA @ talk "Nicht alle Magie ist schön, Erika."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:212
translate de qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_9fe99013:

    # ERIKA @ talk "[regina_ref_cap!t], please, you must learn to keep those kinds of beliefs quiet."
    ERIKA @ talk "[regina_ref_cap!t], bitte, du musst lernen, solche Ansichten für dich zu behalten."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/TheTerminus/scr_0_TerminusDay.rpy:213
translate de qst_Terminus_KitchenEnterMorning_13a6fd6f:

